## User-specific settings (각 사용자 IDE 상태 — 공유 금지)
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcuserdatad/
*.xccheckout

## Build artifacts
build/
DerivedData/
*.moved-aside
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## Archives & Playground
*.xcarchive
timeline.xctimeline
playground.xcworkspace

